  "description": "Dataverse Excel Mapping & Data Quality Studio: a configuration-driven import validator for teams working with Excel migration templates. Map Excel or CSV headers to Dataverse columns by display or logical name, validate required fields, data types, lengths, ranges, choices and lookups (checked against Dataverse in batches), preview the transformed values before importing, report unmapped columns without stopping, and export row-level errors with suggested corrections to Excel or CSV. Mappings are saved as reusable, shareable profiles.",
