  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2026.10.4: The package icon is now referenced by URL (served by GitHub as image/png) so the XrmToolBox Tool Library accepts it. No functional changes.\n\n1.2026.10.3: Republished so nuget.org serves the package icon as image/png (required by the XrmToolBox Tool Library). No functional changes.\n\n1.2026.10.2: Republished for the same reason; nuget.org again stored the icon as application/octet-stream.\n\n1.2026.10.1: First release.\n- Excel (.xlsx/.xlsm) and CSV input with sheet and header-row selection\n- Auto-mapping by display name, logical name, schema name, abbreviations and similarity\n- Validation of required columns, text length and e-mail/URL formats, numbers, ranges and precision, dates, Yes/No, choices, multi-select choices, status/status reason pairs, lookups and duplicate keys\n- Transforms, value maps and default values per column\n- Preview of transformed values, issues list with suggested fixes\n- Export to Excel (summary, issues, data with fixes, preview) or CSV; import template generator\n- Reusable mapping profiles",
